{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>El</b> — it is the strong one whom the holy ones, who are not body, fear, and its attributes are many for the sod." "<b>awesome over all around Him</b> — they are the great host, for they are body."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {0 "Reading רבה as 'many'; the phrase ורבה תואר לסוד is cryptic and rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:26.575673429Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}